FFmpeg minimal cross-build (audio probe only) for Rhythmc maker

Version:  6.1.1 (official FFmpeg source)
Build:    cross-compiled for Windows x64 (mingw-w64), audio-only feature set
License:  LGPL v2.1-or-later (built without --enable-gpl)
Source:   https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-6.1.1.tar.xz

Why this binary exists
----------------------
The previous bundled ffprobe was gyan.dev's "essentials" static build (~82.7 MB).
That build ships every video codec/accelerator (x264, x265, aom, vpx, nvenc, cuda,
libvmaf ...) which this mod never uses. Rhythmc maker only probes audio: it reads
audio duration and runs an onset/spectral-flux filter chain for BPM detection.
A minimal build keeps exactly those features and shrinks ffprobe from ~82.7 MB to
~2.3 MB while producing byte-identical output for every operation the mod performs.

Rebuild
-------
Run tools/ffmpeg-minimal/build.sh (inside WSL/Linux with mingw-w64 installed).
See tools/ffmpeg-minimal/README.md for requirements and verification steps.
